<description>&lt;p&gt;A truck bomb near a Colombian military base killed four civilians, among them a newborn, while a Venezuelan army strike on an ELN camp in Apure killed at least 19 combatants. President De la Espriella is expanding militarization along the Venezuelan border and cutting resources for the human-rights court, threatening its capacity to address abuses. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9RLVIyRmF3c3FqejlDUkFXZUd0VHV5al9GcE9XQW5aQkI5UHdnUnJib01NaUs0V3hzZUtqLUhObGNscm9OZUxqZ2hJVHN3bmtEanhzbXhTZWd1LTVteXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5fWW05WWFRdXd6bFJjVU5RMko0dHdmalg4RWJQeF9HRnRyd1VPS2VrWWF0T0haQ2l2WGppRU5EVE1xZU1PbE1VeFVMWFVVdmhJMXVhQVlvdFV6OHpv?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1qeVNCWjd3bi1wMDNIQUwzdjZVc1FBTE52Y3JOT1ozaW5qYzBqcnZhVzVxTFBVeHhpSVVac0E4U00zM1JnNmpyOTNsXzduZUFBMi1UeTR1eF9veGNqaUZwbzhIN19SYm5VNGtNbVJFM25Na3BHQVJibzFWR25HUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Justice For Colombia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOb0VraUs0RGpiM2stNWE0d2pfWFpXTEQyYi0xRTN4M3NiLXRFUEcxZmlNTF9qTVdoWXhDZUxnSHBkY0JZeERYR2FMallFelRydk9tcFBwaUFrbDI3SzYwQkNJRTU0SjBYRVNxQlBYQmZJaE56NXhkM1RWRnNxRkMzTFJVaUNoeGRRWmJONnRMdmd1N2w2Wm51ZU9jb1Y4THM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Operativ Məlumat Mərkəzi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi